    "text": "I, Aththanayaka Mudiyanselage Kasun Srinath Aththanayaka, Returning Officer of the Ninthavur Pradeshiya Sabha, do hereby declare under Section 10A(1)(a) of the (Chapter 262) Local Authorities Elections Ordinance that Mr. Atham Bawa Ashfer of the Ninthavur Pradeshiya Sabha has vacated his office of member of that Pradeshiya Sabha as he has been ceased to be a member of the All Ceylon Makkal Congress.",
